title: Character of the Party
subtitle: Where PPS builds its reach.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
card-image: img/workers.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_party_rules && PolishParty.stanceAvailable(Q, 'electoral_base') !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card party.electoral_base (catalogue 4.5; technical reference 10.6): 1 T, 0 R, the card then waits 6 months. The present line is shown and cannot be
// chosen again; closing the card is free (Z — 0.32).
PolishParty.stanceView(Q, 'electoral_base');
!}

= Character of the Party

The present line: **[+ pl_stance_current +]**. A new declaration costs this month's action; it changes no law in force and gives no reform by itself.

- @workers
- @workers_peasants
- @broad_democratic
- @allied_reach
- @easy_discard

@workers
title: A workers’ party
subtitle: +0.10 to the growth of reach in the three union branches and the workers’ cells.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.stanceStatus(Q, 'electoral_base', 'workers').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_stance_workers_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.stanceChoose(Q, 'electoral_base', 'workers');
!}
go-to: result

@workers_peasants
title: A party of workers and peasants
subtitle: The same, and in the peasants’ cells.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.stanceStatus(Q, 'electoral_base', 'workers_peasants').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_stance_workers_peasants_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.stanceChoose(Q, 'electoral_base', 'workers_peasants');
!}
go-to: result

@broad_democratic
title: A broad democratic party
subtitle: +0.10 in the cells of the intelligentsia and the petty bourgeoisie.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.stanceStatus(Q, 'electoral_base', 'broad_democratic').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_stance_broad_democratic_why +]
