@allied_reach
title: Our own profile, and reach through allies
subtitle: A partner’s reach only with its consent; no multiplier.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.stanceStatus(Q, 'electoral_base', 'allied_reach').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_stance_allied_reach_why +]
on-arrival: {!
